        "original_id": "57023c2f-af99-500e-9d2a-e329a391008e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lev Sedov, Leon Trotsky, Natalia Sedova\n- Organizations: Russian Social Democratic Labour Party, Bolsheviks, Menshevik Internationalists, Communist Party\n- Topics: Russian communism, October Revolution\n\nFacts:\n- Lev Sedov was born on 24 February 1906 and was the son of Leon Trotsky and Trotsky's second wife Natalia Sedova.\n- Leon Trotsky initially supported the Menshevik Internationalists faction within the Russian Social Democratic Labour Party.\n- Leon Trotsky joined the Bolsheviks just before the 1917 October Revolution.\n- Leon Trotsky immediately became a leader within the Communist Party after joining the Bolsheviks.\n- Lev Sedov, also known as Leon Sedov, died on 16 February 1938.",
